experiments/**                     | -   | docs
refs/**                            | -   | docs
LICENSE                            | -   | docs
.gitleaks.toml                     | -   | docs
.gitignore                         | -   | docs
ci/check-public.py                 | -   | docs
ci/check-doc-links.sh              | -   | docs
ci/gen-cli-reference.sh            | wicket-cli | docs
changes/**                         | -   | docs
ci/changelog.py                    | -   | docs
ci/changelog_test.py               | -   | docs

# ---- inputs the crates read from outside their directories (the self-test checks this list) ----
examples/**                        | wicket-core wicket-authz wicket-feed wicket-policy wicket-cli | -
examples/policy/**                 | wicket-policy | policy
images/**                          | wicket-cli | smoke acceptance
deploy/install.sh                  | wicket-cli | install-test daemon-uids
